Why else would someone want to make a todo app?

I made this so that I can practice C++. I have experience with C. In fact, C is or at least one of my favourite programming languages. I have recently applied for a programming course at college, and apart of that is OOP. I do not know much about OOP. So i thought "Whats a language similar to C, that provides OOP for me to learn?". That's right... C++. That's the point of this. I just wanna learn OOP. 